cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this work, cite the concept DOI unless you need to pin an exact
  version.
title: >-
  Forseti probes 2026: five preregistered experiments on Norwegian
  public-service fact checking
abstract: >-
  Nine pieces of work on whether a language model's handling of Norwegian
  public-service facts can be checked mechanically. Five are preregistered
  experiments with a hypothesis, a criterion fixed before running, and a
  verdict; four are engineering tasks with no hypothesis to preregister. Four
  of five preregistered criteria were not met, and the useful result is a
  preregistered control that fired. v1.1.0 adds fase 2b, a consequence map
  from an amendment published in Norsk Lovtidend to the register rows that
  rest on the amended paragraph, and four saturation guards over the register
  and the tail.
